// so re-sending one that may have landed is a genuine second post in someone's
// group. ⛔ "A duplicate is worse than a gap" — the account's #1 sensitivity.
//
// Listed explicitly rather than derived: classifyDomFailover treats every
// unknown string as maybe-landed, but 'UNKNOWN' from the Fast path SHOULD still
// retry (it is idempotence-protected). Only these are the uncertain DOM ones.
//
// 🔑 Module-scoped deliberately. It has two readers with opposite jobs —
