//                 midnight only, so a post scheduled late in the evening could fire again
//                 inside its 2-hour grace window after midnight: the whole campaign, twice.
//   · recurring — `triggeredIds` kept the id, and the cron skips a triggered id until the
//                 browser restarts: the schedule stopped firing, silently, for days.
